  "section": "25",
  "quote": "A landlord may enter a rental unit only in accordance with section 26 or 27.",
  "reason": "Section 25 restricts landlord entry to the specific circumstances permitted under section 26 or 27, which require emergency, tenant consent, or at least 24 hours written notice for inspections. A clause permitting unannounced drop-in entry conflicts with this rule and is therefore void under section 4."
}

